1
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:09,549
(Raj(voice off):)Hey, buddy, how's it going up there?

2
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,680
(Howard:)You don't have to shout, Raj.

3
00:00:11,851 --> 00:00:15,381
(Howard:)It's not like I'm an astronaut
floating around in outer space.

4
00:00:15,555 --> 00:00:17,685
(Howard:)Oh, wait, I am.

5
00:00:21,561 --> 00:00:23,961
(Leonard:)So is it everything
you hoped it would be?

6
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:26,860
(Howard:)It's better.
Heh, I wake up every morning...

7
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:31,363
(Howard:)...and I just can't believe
I'm on this incredible adventure.

8
00:00:31,538 --> 00:00:35,198
(Dimitri:)Hey, Froot Loops,
did you clean the space toilet?

9
00:00:37,043 --> 00:00:39,413
(Howard:)Excuse me, I'm talking to my friends.

10
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:43,239
(Mike:)You know the rules,
new guy scrubs the toilet.

11
00:00:45,084 --> 00:00:48,524
(Dimitri:)If you do good job,
next time we give you brush.

12
00:00:52,458 --> 00:00:53,618
(Howard:)Funny.

13
00:00:53,793 --> 00:00:56,763
(Howard:)We're always giving each other
a hard time up here.

14
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,590
(Howard:)It's kind of like being in a frat.

15
00:00:58,765 --> 00:01:03,065
(Howard:)You know, joking, kidding around,
hurting feelings.

